  "notes": [
    "The canonical employee source key and Fineract staff externalId are ID_EMPRESA:ID_PERSONA.",
    "This service creates Fineract staff profiles only. It does not create m_appuser accounts, roles, permissions, client assignments, loan assignments, or collection-manager assignments.",
    "The declared PERSONAS_SUCURSAL relationship supplies the preferred current or retained office assignment. When that row is entirely absent, PERSONAS_EMPRESA.ID_SUCURSAL supplies the reviewed fallback office.",
    "Fineract requires joiningDate. FECHA_INGRESO is preferred, PERSONAS_SUCURSAL.FECHA_INICIO is second, and 2020-10-01 is the reviewed legacy-snapshot fallback when both are null.",
    "isLoanOfficer is target-owned and omitted. Fineract defaults it to false on create; a later reviewed assignment service may manage it.",
    "Phone and email are migrated into Fineract staff core fields; the versioned destination migration exposes staff email through the API and permits legacy duplicate phone values.",
    "The one-to-one credesal_staff_profile datatable preserves all PERSONAS_EMPRESA profile fields plus non-permission legacy-login metadata.",
    "Arissto PASSWORD and permission flags are never copied. Fineract application-user creation remains a separate service because every user requires a reviewed role and a newly generated policy-compliant password."
  ]
